  "slug": "apartment-pet-screening-form",
  "title": "Apartment Animal Request and Pet Screening Record",
  "subtitle": "Classify the request correctly, separate assistance-animal accommodation routing, document household-pet facts, apply written criteria consistently, authorize conditions, and close the registration workflow.",
  "description": "A fair-housing-aware apartment animal request record that separates assistance-animal accommodation handling from household-pet screening, then captures pet identity, care records, behavior history, emergency planning, neutral policy review, decision authority, conditions, registration, and follow-up.",
  "use_case": "Use when a resident asks to keep an animal and property staff need a fillable routing record that prevents assistance-animal requests from being treated as pet applications while supporting a consistent, evidence-based household-pet review and accountable move-in process.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
